			"notes": "## ✨ New settings UI\n\nThe config screen is now powered by **MoulConfig** — the same config engine you know from **NotEnoughUpdates and SkyHanni**:\n\n- Categories sidebar: **General / Surfaces / Online Translation**\n- Built-in **search bar** across all options\n- Language and provider as proper dropdowns, request limit as a slider\n- Settings **apply instantly** when you save — no restart needed\n- Open with the `O` key or Mod Menu → Configure\n- The in-game **Translation Editor** (fix any string by hand) lives behind its button in General\n\n## Changes\n\n- Config file format is now grouped by category — old configs from 0.2.0 will reset to defaults (sorry, alpha!)\n- MoulConfig and Fabric Language Kotlin are bundled inside the jar — still nothing to install besides Fabric API\n\n## Requirements\n\nMinecraft **26.2** · Fabric Loader ≥ 0.19.3 · **Fabric API**\n\n> Alpha build. Report bugs in Discord or GitHub Issues."
