			"notes": "First public alpha of **SkyBlock Translator** — a client-side Fabric mod that translates Hypixel SkyBlock into your language, live on your screen.\n\n## Features (Free)\n\n- Translates **item names & lore, menus, NPC dialogues & system chat, scoreboard sidebar, tab list, boss bars**\n- **Real-time**: unknown text goes through a free online translator and updates as you look at it; every result is cached locally forever\n- Curated built-in dictionary for Russian (growing), machine translation for 10 more languages: de, es, fr, ja, ko, pl, pt-BR, tr, uk, zh\n- **In-game settings UI** (Mod Menu button or `O` key): language, per-surface toggles, online provider/budget, and a **string editor** — fix any translation by hand, your edits always win\n- Colors, formatting and §k decorations are preserved; the game underneath stays English (other mods, search and commands are unaffected)\n- Player names are never sent to any online translator\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft **26.2**\n- Fabric Loader ≥ 0.19.3 + **Fabric API**\n- (YACL is bundled; Mod Menu recommended)\n\n## Install\n\nDrop the jar into your `mods` folder alongside Fabric API. Settings: Mod Menu → SkyBlock Translator, or press `O` in game.\n\n> ⚠️ Alpha: expect rough machine translations here and there — fix them in the built-in string editor, or wait for the Premium LLM translator that's coming next. Bug reports welcome in Discord / GitHub Issues."
